[ Flutter Mobile App ]
   │
   ├── Code & Syntax  ──> re_editor (Local Canvas)
   ├── Terminal View  ──> xterm.dart
   ├── Local Git      ──> git2dart (libgit2 via FFI) ──> GitHub / GitLab (HTTPS)
   │
   └── Run / Compile Request (HTTPS)
          │
          ▼
   [ Serverless JS (Hono) ]
          │
          ├──> [ Redis Cloud (Upstash) ] ── (Rate-limit & Output Cache)
          ├──> [ MySQL (PlanetScale) ]    ── (User metadata, repos list)
          │
          ▼
   [ Execution Engine (Piston / Judge0) ] ──> Returns stdout / stderr